{
    "Description": {
        "Id": "forceevent_co_LutefiskLauncher_2_8x3",
        "Name": "Fishing for Lutefisk",
        "Details": "You stumble across [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] in the machine shop aboard the <i>Argo</i>. Spread across several workbenches are mortar components, cabling, control assemblies, and a collection of tools. {SCN_MW.Callsign} is studying the parts with an expression of intense concentration.\r\n\r\nYou look over the components. \"I assume this has something to do with the Lutefisk Launcher.\"\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign} looks up and smiles.\r\n\r\n\"Indeed, Commander. I finally have a workable design.\" {SCN_MW.Subj_C} gestures toward the components. \"I need enough mortar launchers to give me 25 tubes.  So for example, one Mortar 2, three Mortar 8s, and an FCS Scatter to link it together.  I'll also need an FCS Calibrator, which we can hire from [[TGT_SYSTEM,{TGT_SYSTEM.Name}]]. With those components, I can assemble the twenty-five-tube launcher I've been planning.\"\r\n\r\nYou look at the growing pile of equipment. \"And how much is this going to cost us?\"\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign} hesitates. \"Should be less than three million C-Bills, once we account for the parts, fabrication, modifications, and everything else required to put it together properly.\"\r\n\r\nYou sigh. \"And the catch?\"\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign} gestures toward the machine shop. \"I will need to supervise the construction myself. That means I'll be out of the combat rotation for approximately four weeks. The additional work will also take some of the <i>Argo</i>'s AsTech staff away from their normal duties, reducing the <i>Argo</i>'s efficiency during the construction period.\"\r\n\r\nYou look over the components again.\r\n\r\nOne Mortar 2.\r\n\r\nThree Mortar 8s.\r\n\r\nOne FCS Scatter.\r\n\r\nThree million C-Bills.\r\n\r\nFour weeks of {SCN_MW.Callsign} being unavailable for combat and reduced AsTech efficiency aboard the <i>Argo</i>.\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign} waits patiently for your response. \"So, Commander. Shall we build the Lutefisk Launcher?\"",
        "Icon": "uixTxrSpot_JarlWorkshop.png"
    },
