                        "Id": "outcome_0_0",
                        "Name": "Nothing happens",
                        "Details": "You look over the components one more time before shaking your head. \"Not yet, {SCN_MW.Callsign}. Three million C-Bills is more than we can justify right now. I also need you available for active duty, and we can't afford to reduce the <i>Argo</i>'s AsTech efficiency for four weeks.  Let's revisit this in a few months.\"\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign}'s expression falls, but {SCN_MW.Subj} nods. \"Understood, Commander. The launcher can wait.\" {SCN_MW.Subj_C} begins gathering the components and returning them to storage.\r\n\r\n\"When the time is right, we'll build it properly.\"",
