                        "Id": "outcome_1_0",
                        "Name": "Work in Progress",
                        "Details": "You look over the components before making your decision. \"Build it, [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]]. One Mortar 2, six Mortar 4s, and the FCS Scatter.\"\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign}'s face breaks into a broad grin. \"Excellent, Commander! I'll begin immediately.\"\r\n\r\nYou authorize the ¢2,000,000 C-Bill expenditure and accept that {SCN_MW.Callsign} will be removed from combat rotation while the project is completed.\r\n\r\nThe machine shop comes alive as {SCN_MW.Callsign} begins laying out the components for the twenty-five-tube launcher. The <i>Argo</i>'s AsTech efficiency will be reduced for the next four weeks, but at the end of it, {SCN_MW.Callsign} should have {SCN_MW.Det} [[DM.WeaponDefs[Unique_Weapon_Mortar_Lutefisk],{DM.WeaponDefs[Unique_Weapon_Mortar_Lutefisk].Description.Manufacturer} {DM.WeaponDefs[Unique_Weapon_Mortar_Lutefisk].Description.Model}]].\"\r\n\r\n<color=#33bbee><b>Check a refreshed system shop to buy an <i>INSPECTION CERTIFICATE</i> after 28 days has passed to complete Jarl's Launcher Project after Jarl loses the <i>TINKERING</i> tag.</b></color>",
