                        "Name": "Work in Progress",
                        "Details": "You study the available mortar components. \"Build it, [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]]. But use the Mortar 2, four Mortar 6s, and the FCS Scatter.\"\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign} considers the arrangement for a moment before nodding.\r\n\r\n\"That configuration should work. The larger mortar assemblies will require some additional fabrication, but I can adapt them to the launcher design.\"\r\n\r\nYou authorize the approximately ¢2,500,000 C-Bill expenditure and accept the four-week disruption to {SCN_MW.Callsign}'s combat availability and the <i>Argo</i>'s AsTech efficiency.\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign} immediately begins arranging the components, already planning how to integrate the four Mortar 6s into {SCN_MW.Det} [[DM.WeaponDefs[Unique_Weapon_Mortar_Lutefisk],{DM.WeaponDefs[Unique_Weapon_Mortar_Lutefisk].Description.Manufacturer} {DM.WeaponDefs[Unique_Weapon_Mortar_Lutefisk].Description.Model}]].\r\n\r\n<color=#33bbee><b>Check a refreshed system shop to buy an <i>INSPECTION CERTIFICATE</i> after 28 days has passed to complete Jarl's Launcher Project after Jarl loses the <i>TINKERING</i> tag.</b></color>",
