                        "Id": "outcome_3_0",
                        "Name": "Work in Progress",
                        "Details": "You look over the largest mortar components available.\r\n\r\n\"Build it, [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]]. Go ahead and use the Mortar 2, three Mortar 8s, and the FCS Scatter.\"\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign} stares at the components for several seconds before a slow grin spreads across {SCN_MW.Det} face.\r\n\r\n\"That is an ambitious configuration, Commander. I like it.\"\r\n\r\nYou authorize the ¢3,000,000 C-Bill expenditure and accept that {SCN_MW.Callsign} will be out of combat rotation while the project is completed, with the <i>Argo</i>'s AsTech efficiency reduced for four weeks.\r\n\r\n{SCN_MW.Callsign} begins examining the three Mortar 8s, already considering how to integrate them into the launcher.\r\n\r\n\"[[DM.WeaponDefs[Unique_Weapon_Mortar_Lutefisk],{DM.WeaponDefs[Unique_Weapon_Mortar_Lutefisk].Description.Manufacturer} {DM.WeaponDefs[Unique_Weapon_Mortar_Lutefisk].Description.Model}]]... twenty-five tubes, Commander. With this configuration, we will have created something very impressive.\"\r\n\r\n<color=#33bbee><b>Check a refreshed system shop to buy an <i>INSPECTION CERTIFICATE</i> after 28 days has passed to complete Jarl's Launcher Project after Jarl loses the <i>TINKERING</i> tag.</b></color>",
